# The dietician's own documents.
#
# `npm run data:build` reads these to produce the archive in
# src/data/generated, and the archive is what the app ships, so the originals
# are only ever needed on the machine doing the import. They are somebody's
# named medical correspondence and this repository is public, so they stay out
# of it. Drop them in data/source and rebuild; nothing here will offer to
# commit them.
data/source/

